# PET disk-loading smoke test - real D64 image (roms/pet/test-disks/games-1.d64, imported from
# personal-001), driven through PetDebuggerSession the same way personal-003's Retro.Debugger
# .dbg scripts drive an attach + boot check. See scripts/pet-tape-loading.dbg for the tape analog.
profile pet-2001-32
roms roms/pet
devices
disk roms/pet/test-disks/games-1.d64
devices
trace 50
status
